  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **BIT**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Señor (Tales of Yankee Power) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2016-10-29.sbd.schoepsMK21.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 10 songs; 56 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2016-10-29.sbd.schoepsMK21.flac24**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 9 songs; 56 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Band introductions were placed between Freeborn Man and Dust in a Baggie in this listing [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2016-10-29.sbd.schoepsMK21.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Soundboard+Schoeps MK21's>KCY250/05i>VST62iu>SD788t [1]. Also: Filename describes a matrix mix of soundboard and Schoeps MK21 microphone sources, in 16-bit FLAC; Schoeps MK21 mics placed on stage, running through Schoeps KCY 250/05i and VST62iu into a Sound Devices 788t recorder; Tracks were aligned and mixed in Nuendo 4, then faded in Sound Forge Pro 11 [1][3]\n- **billystrings2016-10-29.sbd.schoepsMK21.flac24**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Soundboard>Sound Devices 788t + Schoeps MK21's (On Stage)>Schoeps KCY 250/05i>Schoeps VST62iu>Sound Devices 788t [2]. Also: Mixed and aligned in Nuendo 4, faded in Sound Forge Pro 11, with no bit-depth reduction listed; FLAC via Trader's Little Helper [2]",
